   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Two-Handed Weapons</p>\n<p><em>“Now I can dual wield my rifles just like in the BDs! How do I hide them when I go to the club? Duh. Obviously, I don’t go to clubs.”</em></p>\n<p>The weapon can now be wielded One-Handed, but can no longer be concealed and cannot be installed as a Popup Weapon or installed into Vehicle Heavy Weapon Mounts. This mod and the weapon cannot be Tech Upgraded to remove any of these penalties.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
